    "message": "Add the per-lane tick budget check and the how-to for owning a namespace\n\nbenchmarks/tick_budget.py runs base, base and lane at once on a fork late in a stored Run and\ncompares the thread CPU time of the tick. docs/rust-port/lanes/p4-world-core.md says what a lane\ndoes to own a namespace, with the sample as its template, and what was measured.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
